1
00:00:00,653 --> 00:00:01,683
(Elon:)so you're probably
a good person.

2
00:00:01,754 --> 00:00:05,394
(Howard:)Oh. I made my wife come down,
too.

3
00:00:05,458 --> 00:00:08,628
(Elon:)You think you might
ever get back out to space?

4
00:00:08,695 --> 00:00:12,535
Is that a job offer? 'Cause
I really want to go to Mars.

5
00:00:12,599 --> 00:00:13,569
(Howard:)Assuming I can
bring my wife.

6
00:00:13,633 --> 00:00:15,133
(Howard:)She hardly takes up any room.

7
00:00:15,201 --> 00:00:18,041
(Howard:)She's basically a carry-on.

8
00:00:18,104 --> 00:00:19,674
(Elon:)Well, we're not quite there yet,

9
00:00:19,739 --> 00:00:21,439
(Elon:)but we're always looking
for engineers.

10
00:00:21,508 --> 00:00:23,278
(Elon:)So let me give you my e-mail.
We can stay in touch.

11
00:00:23,343 --> 00:00:24,873
(Amy:)Thank you.

12
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:28,410
(Penny:)Oh, look.

13
00:00:28,481 --> 00:00:30,011
(Elon:)Someone hardly touched
their pumpkin pie.

14
00:00:30,083 --> 00:00:33,423
(Elon:)Want to share it with me?

15
00:00:33,486 --> 00:00:37,426
A-a partially eaten piece
of pumpkin pie

16
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:39,160
(Howard:)from a homeless shelter?

17
00:00:39,225 --> 00:00:41,295
With Elon Musk, you bet I do!

18
00:00:41,361 --> 00:00:43,961
(both chuckling)

19
00:00:46,232 --> 00:00:48,932
(Sheldon:)You know, for a
Thanksgiving buffet

20
00:00:49,002 --> 00:00:52,942
(Amy:)in an aquarium cafeteria,
that was really bad.

21
00:00:53,006 --> 00:00:55,676
(Amy:)You're just upset 'cause
they ran out of Pilgrim hats.

22
00:00:55,742 --> 00:00:59,082
(Sheldon:)They gave one to that baby.
He wasn't even awake.

23
00:00:59,145 --> 00:01:03,915
(Amy:)Well, it wouldn't be a holiday
without you being mad at a baby.

